# Optional: extra CA certificate(s) for building the image behind a TLS-inspecting company proxy.
# Paste the proxy's PEM certificate(s) below these comment lines, or run
#   BUILD_CA_FILE=/path/to/ca.pem scripts/install-server.sh
# They are used only while packages are downloaded during the build and are not stored in the image.
# With no certificate here (the normal case) nothing changes.
